# The sources already largely followed Google style, so this mostly records it.
# Pointer alignment is left at Google's default, which normalises the mixture of
# "Type &name" and "Type& name" in the tree to the latter.
#
# The pybind11 binding chains in src/_core.cpp and src/libfranka.cpp are wrapped
# in "clang-format off/on": their hand alignment, one argument group per line,
# reads better than the automatic wrapping, and the same idiom is already used
# for the impedance matrix literals in the controllers.
BasedOnStyle: Google
